5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hello... I'm not very good at this, but I'll try my best to help everyone.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,A calm start is best. Let us observe each other's patterns before we make any assumptions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm sure this will be a breeze. I'll be watching to see who among you is struggling to keep their story straight.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not scared of any wolf! I'll find the bad guy and protect everyone, just watch me!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Victoria. We should prioritize reason and observation over impulsive reactions.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Takumi, you're very brave... I wish I had that kind of confidence.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Bravery is useful, Takumi, but we must not let it lead to recklessness.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. Recklessness is just a shortcut to getting executed by mistake.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being reckless! I'm just ready to fight! @Ryuji, you're too quiet. What are you thinking?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am simply analyzing the group dynamic. There is no need to rush into accusations on day zero.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should all just be kind to each other for now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Kindness is a virtue, Daisuke, but we must remember that the werewolf will use it as a mask.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"How poetic. I wonder if the wolf is already pretending to be the most ""rational"" person here.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, that sounds like you're trying to trick us! I'm keeping my eye on you!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Speculation without evidence is inefficient. Let us wait for the first night to pass.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
