36,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I have some information. I think... I think Ryuji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"That is a very bold claim for the first day, Daisuke. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, well. The quietest member of our group makes the loudest accusation. How unexpected.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I knew it! I felt something was off about Ryuji! Let's get him!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"This is an illogical leap. Daisuke, if you are claiming the Seer role, you are making yourself a target.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I am the Seer. I checked Ryuji last night, and he is the wolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Daisuke is telling the truth, the game is almost over. But we must consider if he is the werewolf lying to frame Ryuji.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"A classic gambit. The wolf claims to be the Seer to eliminate a rival. It's quite a daring move, Daisuke.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, stop trying to confuse us! Daisuke is too shy to lie like that!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Shyness is not a proof of innocence, Takumi. I am a human. Daisuke is attempting to manipulate the vote.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm not lying! I really saw it! Please believe me!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, how do you respond to the specific claim? Do you have a counter-claim to the Seer role?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,He doesn't need one. He just needs to point out that Daisuke's sudden confidence is suspicious.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about ""gambits""! I trust Daisuke! Ryuji, you're the wolf!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I have no reason to claim the Seer role when the truth of my humanity will eventually surface.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
